  "key_points": [
   {
    "text": "Evening power is scarce: Rajasthan cleared only about 10% of its evening exchange bids in September, about 5% in the high-price market above Rs 10/kWh, and its exchange tenders on 2 and 8 October drew no bids. Tamil Nadu says it has secured 15% to 25% of its peak bids even at the Rs 10 ceiling.",
