   {
    "text": "Discoms are paying for it: RERC approved Himachal hydro through PTC at Rs 15.50/kWh and a single trader's peak power at Rs 9.49 to Rs 9.99/kWh, with costs open to prudence check at true-up; RERC called the Himachal deal an exception, not a precedent.",
