   },
   {
    "text": "Storage-backed peak supply is being locked in for 25 years: Rs 6.27 to 6.28/kWh for four hours of evening supply from batteries (SECI FDRE-VII, against Rs 6.74/kWh adopted in June), and Rs 3.12/kWh for TNPDCL's solar with six peak hours from 1,800 MWh of storage.",
