      "code": "tnerc"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Commissions are pushing discoms to plan ahead: RERC directed RUVITL to move on battery storage, FDRE and demand flexibility, and TNERC said short-term tenders are no substitute for long- and medium-term contracts.",
    "basis": [
     {
      "doc": "2b3baf2760e69dc50e1457e7df5c0af71f76a38d8b5060333ae03609af2f3540",
      "pid": "p13.2",
      "href": "/orders/rerc/2026/2450-2026-2b3baf",
      "src": "/pdf/2b3baf2760e69dc5.pdf",
      "code": "rerc"
     },
     {
      "doc": "e226201a92cfd8f4b0a2fc13d4279e0c683b5a880df20396fb8e109df7e349e4",
      "pid": "p17.2",
      "href": "/orders/tnerc/2026/m-p-no-23-of-2026-e22620",
      "src": "https://tnerc.tn.gov.in/Orders/files/CO-MPNo23%20221020261439.pdf",
      "code": "tnerc"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "The full ISTS waiver for delayed wind and solar projects ends with 30 June 2026. CERC refused it to four Tata Power Renewable projects due after that date even though transmission was late, and confirmed it for a 198 MW project that reached COD within its extended date.",
    "basis": [
     {
      "doc": "cba276a48f21810757e9b1c7f6ddd91e4a35a5df17180838ed4abe3f4301333d",
      "pid": "p11.6",
      "href": "/orders/cerc/2026/168-mp-2026-187-mp-2026-193-mp-2026-289-mp-2026-cba276",
      "src": "https://cercind.gov.in/2026/Orders/187-MP-2026-Ors.pdf",
      "code": "cerc"
     },
     {
      "doc": "8c34b46430954acb27a9a02c2240b71f581ff477012fde4d7ef207911f091c9c",
      "pid": "p7.5",
      "href": "/orders/cerc/2026/169-mp-2026-8c34b4",
      "src": "https://cercind.gov.in/2026/Orders/169-MP-2026.pdf",
      "code": "cerc"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "A pending force majeure claim does not protect a bank guarantee: GERC declined to stop GUVNL encashing a BESS developer's guarantee and pointed it to the contract's paid extension of Rs 1,000 per MW per day.",
